# ---- Runtime data: NEVER commit ----
# students.db holds real student records, guardians, payment history, refunds
# and bcrypt password hashes. uploads/ holds student photos and payment proofs.
# Publishing either would expose personal data of minors and their families.
students.db
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
uploads/

